    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing, I don't see a way to nourish anything. Every time I try, I just mess it up more. It feels less like a \"different role\" and more like I'm just a parasite. People look at me and they don't see a person, they see a disappointment. It's like seeing someone being dragged down by a heavy weight that doesn't belong there. If I wasn't here, the tree would just... stand straight again. It would be cleaner.",
